    },
    {
      "text": "with such",
      "startMs": "26160",
      "endMs": "32119",
      "startTimeText": "0:26"
    },
    {
      "text": "riveting performances, the singers,",
      "startMs": "27840",
      "endMs": "35160",
      "startTimeText": "0:27"
    },
    {
      "text": "beautiful children of Bal Vikas and",
      "startMs": "32119",
      "endMs": "37840",
      "startTimeText": "0:32"
    },
    {
      "text": "students from all over.",
      "startMs": "35160",
      "endMs": "41120",
      "startTimeText": "0:35"
    },
    {
      "text": "Welcome. Thank you for being here",
      "startMs": "37840",
      "endMs": "43640",
      "startTimeText": "0:37"
    },
    {
      "text": "on this historic and sacred occasion of",
      "startMs": "41120",
      "endMs": "45600",
      "startTimeText": "0:41"
    },
    {
      "text": "the centenary celebrations of Bhagwan",
      "startMs": "43640",
      "endMs": "47760",
      "startTimeText": "0:43"
    },
    {
      "text": "Shri Sathya Sai Baba.",
      "startMs": "45600",
      "endMs": "51200",
      "startTimeText": "0:45"
    },
    {
      "text": "My heart is filled with deep devotion",
      "startMs": "47760",
      "endMs": "53920",
      "startTimeText": "0:47"
    },
    {
      "text": "and gratitude.",
      "startMs": "51200",
      "endMs": "56320",
      "startTimeText": "0:51"
    },
    {
      "text": "Though a century may have passed since",
      "startMs": "53920",
      "endMs": "58320",
      "startTimeText": "0:53"
    },
    {
      "text": "his divine birth,",
      "startMs": "56320",
      "endMs": "61680",
      "startTimeText": "0:56"
    },
    {
      "text": "his presence, his principles,",
      "startMs": "58320",
      "endMs": "64800",
      "startTimeText": "0:58"
    },
    {
      "text": "his teachings, guidance, and his",
      "startMs": "61680",
      "endMs": "66320",
      "startTimeText": "1:01"
    },
    {
      "text": "compassion",
      "startMs": "64800",
      "endMs": "69160",
      "startTimeText": "1:04"
    },
    {
      "text": "continue to reverberate in the hearts of",
      "startMs": "66320",
      "endMs": "72320",
      "startTimeText": "1:06"
    },
    {
      "text": "millions worldwide.",
      "startMs": "69160",
      "endMs": "76040",
      "startTimeText": "1:09"
    },
    {
      "text": "I extend a heartfelt thank you to you,",
      "startMs": "72320",
      "endMs": "78000",
      "startTimeText": "1:12"
    },
    {
      "text": "our honorable Prime Minister Narendra",
      "startMs": "76040",
      "endMs": "80200",
      "startTimeText": "1:16"
    },
    {
      "text": "Modi ji,",
      "startMs": "78000",
      "endMs": "82400",
      "startTimeText": "1:18"
    },
    {
      "text": "for being with us here today",
      "startMs": "80200",
      "endMs": "85560",
      "startTimeText": "1:20"
    },
    {
      "text": "and for honoring this special occasion.",
      "startMs": "82400",
      "endMs": "87920",
      "startTimeText": "1:22"
    },
    {
      "text": "I'm looking forward to listening to your",
      "startMs": "85560",
      "endMs": "90880",
      "startTimeText": "1:25"
    },
    {
      "text": "wise words, impactful and inspiring as",
      "startMs": "87920",
      "endMs": "93720",
      "startTimeText": "1:27"
    },
    {
      "text": "always, to enthrall us this today this",
      "startMs": "90880",
      "endMs": "95920",
      "startTimeText": "1:30"
    },
    {
      "text": "morning.",
      "startMs": "93720",
      "endMs": "99240",
      "startTimeText": "1:33"
    },
    {
      "text": "Your presence here adds sanctity and",
      "startMs": "95920",
      "endMs": "103240",
      "startTimeText": "1:35"
    },
    {
      "text": "inspiration to the centenary celebration",
      "startMs": "99240",
      "endMs": "106640",
      "startTimeText": "1:39"
    },
    {
      "text": "and reminds us of Swami's message",
      "startMs": "103240",
      "endMs": "110480",
      "startTimeText": "1:43"
    },
    {
      "text": "that true leadership is service, and",
      "startMs": "106640",
      "endMs": "115440",
      "startTimeText": "1:46"
    },
    {
      "text": "service to man is service to God.",
      "startMs": "110480",
      "endMs": "115440",
      "startTimeText": "1:50"
    },
    {
      "text": "I stand here today and in all humility",
      "startMs": "117920",
      "endMs": "123000",
      "startTimeText": "1:57"
    },
    {
      "text": "and honesty can say",
      "startMs": "120920",
      "endMs": "125200",
      "startTimeText": "2:00"
    },
    {
      "text": "that this divine message",
      "startMs": "123000",
      "endMs": "127960",
      "startTimeText": "2:03"
    },
    {
      "text": "I have always held deeply close to my",
      "startMs": "125200",
      "endMs": "131959",
      "startTimeText": "2:05"
    },
    {
      "text": "heart and put into practice in life.",
      "startMs": "127960",
      "endMs": "135320",
      "startTimeText": "2:07"
    },
    {
      "text": "Once a Bal Vikas student, always a Bal",
      "startMs": "131959",
      "endMs": "137551",
      "startTimeText": "2:11"
    },
    {
      "text": "Vikas student.",
      "startMs": "135320",
      "endMs": "139571",
      "startTimeText": "2:15"
    },
    {
      "text": ">> [applause]",
      "startMs": "137551",
      "endMs": "139571",
      "startTimeText": "2:17"
    },
    {
      "text": ">> Bhagwan Sri Sathya Sai Baba often spoke",
      "startMs": "142040",
      "endMs": "146840",
      "startTimeText": "2:22"
    },
    {
      "text": "about the five D's.",
      "startMs": "144720",
      "endMs": "149760",
      "startTimeText": "2:24"
    },
    {
      "text": "Five essential qualities needed for a",
      "startMs": "146840",
      "endMs": "152840",
      "startTimeText": "2:26"
    },
    {
      "text": "meaningful, purposeful, and spiritually",
      "startMs": "149760",
      "endMs": "155080",
      "startTimeText": "2:29"
    },
    {
      "text": "anchored life.",
      "startMs": "152840",
      "endMs": "156600",
      "startTimeText": "2:32"
    },
    {
      "text": "Discipline.",
      "startMs": "155080",
      "endMs": "158680",
      "startTimeText": "2:35"
    },
    {
      "text": "Discipline is the mark of a true human",
      "startMs": "156600",
      "endMs": "159680",
      "startTimeText": "2:36"
    },
    {
      "text": "being.",
      "startMs": "158680",
      "endMs": "161400",
      "startTimeText": "2:38"
    },
    {
      "text": "Dedication.",
      "startMs": "159680",
      "endMs": "163240",
      "startTimeText": "2:39"
    },
    {
      "text": "Whatever you do,",
      "startMs": "161400",
      "endMs": "167040",
      "startTimeText": "2:41"
    },
    {
      "text": "do it as an offering to God.",
      "startMs": "163240",
      "endMs": "168640",
      "startTimeText": "2:43"
    },
    {
      "text": "Devotion.",
      "startMs": "167040",
      "endMs": "171760",
      "startTimeText": "2:47"
    },
    {
      "text": "True devotion is the flow of love",
      "startMs": "168640",
      "endMs": "173560",
      "startTimeText": "2:48"
    },
    {
      "text": "towards God.",
      "startMs": "171760",
      "endMs": "175520",
      "startTimeText": "2:51"
    },
    {
      "text": "Determination.",
      "startMs": "173560",
      "endMs": "178360",
      "startTimeText": "2:53"
    },
    {
      "text": "Once you have chosen the right path,",
      "startMs": "175520",
      "endMs": "180519",
      "startTimeText": "2:55"
    },
    {
      "text": "never turn back.",
      "startMs": "178360",
      "endMs": "183600",
      "startTimeText": "2:58"
    },
    {
      "text": "And discrimination as in the ability to",
      "startMs": "180519",
      "endMs": "186880",
      "startTimeText": "3:00"
    },
    {
      "text": "choose between right and wrong,",
      "startMs": "183600",
      "endMs": "190120",
      "startTimeText": "3:03"
    },
    {
      "text": "truth and untruth, the very heart of",
      "startMs": "186880",
      "endMs": "192160",
      "startTimeText": "3:06"
    },
    {
      "text": "spiritual life.",
      "startMs": "190120",
      "endMs": "194640",
      "startTimeText": "3:10"
    },
    {
      "text": "Swami once said,",
      "startMs": "192160",
      "endMs": "197800",
      "startTimeText": "3:12"
    },
    {
      "text": "\"Education should not be for a living,",
      "startMs": "194640",
      "endMs": "202680",
      "startTimeText": "3:14"
    },
    {
      "text": "but it is and should be for life.\"",
      "startMs": "197800",
      "endMs": "205800",
      "startTimeText": "3:17"
    },
    {
      "text": "The Sri Sathya Sai Baba education system",
      "startMs": "202680",
      "endMs": "209880",
      "startTimeText": "3:22"
    },
    {
      "text": "is a shining example of this truth.",
      "startMs": "205800",
      "endMs": "212920",
      "startTimeText": "3:25"
    },
    {
      "text": "From Bal Vikas programs to value-based",
      "startMs": "209880",
      "endMs": "216640",
      "startTimeText": "3:29"
    },
    {
      "text": "schools, colleges, and even a free",
      "startMs": "212920",
      "endMs": "219519",
      "startTimeText": "3:32"
    },
    {
      "text": "multi-disciplinary university",
      "startMs": "216640",
      "endMs": "222239",
      "startTimeText": "3:36"
    },
    {
      "text": "serving thousands of students every year",
      "startMs": "219519",
      "endMs": "225720",
      "startTimeText": "3:39"
    },
    {
      "text": "free of cost, without discrimination,",
      "startMs": "222239",
      "endMs": "229280",
      "startTimeText": "3:42"
    },
    {
      "text": "and rooted in values.",
      "startMs": "225720",
      "endMs": "232000",
      "startTimeText": "3:45"
    },
    {
      "text": "Sri Sathya Sai Baba also gifted India",
      "startMs": "229280",
      "endMs": "235160",
      "startTimeText": "3:49"
    },
    {
      "text": "and the world an unparalleled healthcare",
      "startMs": "232000",
      "endMs": "236960",
      "startTimeText": "3:52"
    },
    {
      "text": "model.",
      "startMs": "235160",
      "endMs": "240360",
      "startTimeText": "3:55"
    },
    {
      "text": "His super specialty hospitals here in",
      "startMs": "236960",
      "endMs": "243400",
      "startTimeText": "3:56"
    },
    {
      "text": "Puttaparthi, Whitefield,",
      "startMs": "240360",
      "endMs": "247280",
      "startTimeText": "4:00"
    },
    {
      "text": "provide world-class treatment completely",
      "startMs": "243400",
      "endMs": "250640",
      "startTimeText": "4:03"
    },
    {
      "text": "free of cost to lakhs of people,",
      "startMs": "247280",
      "endMs": "252120",
      "startTimeText": "4:07"
    },
    {
      "text": "proving",
      "startMs": "250640",
      "endMs": "256320",
      "startTimeText": "4:10"
    },
    {
      "text": "that the five C's he always spoke about,",
      "startMs": "252120",
      "endMs": "257600",
      "startTimeText": "4:12"
    },
    {
      "text": "that is",
      "startMs": "256320",
      "endMs": "259120",
      "startTimeText": "4:16"
    },
    {
      "text": "compassion,",
      "startMs": "257600",
      "endMs": "260600",
      "startTimeText": "4:17"
    },
    {
      "text": "charity,",
      "startMs": "259120",
      "endMs": "265240",
      "startTimeText": "4:19"
    },
    {
      "text": "character, calmness, and contentment,",
      "startMs": "260600",
      "endMs": "269360",
      "startTimeText": "4:20"
    },
    {
      "text": "not commerce, must drive caring for all",
      "startMs": "265240",
      "endMs": "272360",
      "startTimeText": "4:25"
    },
    {
      "text": "humankind.",
      "startMs": "269360",
      "endMs": "272360",
      "startTimeText": "4:29"
    },
    {
      "text": "From the historic drinking water mission",
      "startMs": "272560",
      "endMs": "276520",
      "startTimeText": "4:32"
    },
    {
      "text": "that brought portable water to millions",
      "startMs": "274720",
      "endMs": "278280",
      "startTimeText": "4:34"
    },
    {
      "text": "in Andhra Pradesh, Karnataka, and Tamil",
      "startMs": "276520",
      "endMs": "279400",
      "startTimeText": "4:36"
    },
    {
      "text": "Nadu,",
      "startMs": "278280",
      "endMs": "281960",
      "startTimeText": "4:38"
    },
    {
      "text": "to global disaster relief,",
      "startMs": "279400",
      "endMs": "284120",
      "startTimeText": "4:39"
    },
    {
      "text": "rural service,",
      "startMs": "281960",
      "endMs": "286800",
      "startTimeText": "4:41"
    },
    {
      "text": "and youth empowerment programs,",
      "startMs": "284120",
      "endMs": "289360",
      "startTimeText": "4:44"
    },
    {
      "text": "the Sri Sathya Sai organization has",
      "startMs": "286800",
      "endMs": "293960",
      "startTimeText": "4:46"
    },
    {
      "text": "served without seeking reward, guided by",
      "startMs": "289360",
      "endMs": "297000",
      "startTimeText": "4:49"
    },
    {
      "text": "Swami's immortal words,",
      "startMs": "293960",
      "endMs": "299040",
      "startTimeText": "4:53"
    },
    {
      "text": "\"Hands that serve",
      "startMs": "297000",
      "endMs": "303919",
      "startTimeText": "4:57"
    },
    {
      "text": "are holier than lips that pray.\"",
      "startMs": "299040",
      "endMs": "303919",
      "startTimeText": "4:59"
    },
    {
      "text": "Bal Vikas was never just a weekly",
      "startMs": "304640",
      "endMs": "309360",
      "startTimeText": "5:04"
    },
    {
      "text": "gathering for us.",
      "startMs": "307240",
      "endMs": "312440",
      "startTimeText": "5:07"
    },
    {
      "text": "It was a positive space",
      "startMs": "309360",
      "endMs": "316400",
      "startTimeText": "5:09"
    },
    {
      "text": "where where values were not just taught,",
      "startMs": "312440",
      "endMs": "319520",
      "startTimeText": "5:12"
    },
    {
      "text": "but joyfully experienced.",
      "startMs": "316400",
      "endMs": "322000",
      "startTimeText": "5:16"
    },
    {
      "text": "Those years were a divine training",
      "startMs": "319520",
      "endMs": "326520",
      "startTimeText": "5:19"
    },
    {
      "text": "ground that molded minds, hearts, and",
      "startMs": "322000",
      "endMs": "328160",
      "startTimeText": "5:22"
    },
    {
      "text": "spirit.",
      "startMs": "326520",
      "endMs": "331960",
      "startTimeText": "5:26"
    },
    {
      "text": "We learned that practicing Sathya,",
      "startMs": "328160",
      "endMs": "336600",
      "startTimeText": "5:28"
    },
    {
      "text": "Dharma, Shanti, Prema, and Ahimsa",
      "startMs": "331960",
      "endMs": "341080",
      "startTimeText": "5:31"
    },
    {
      "text": "in thought, word, and deed set the very",
      "startMs": "336600",
      "endMs": "346520",
      "startTimeText": "5:36"
    },
    {
      "text": "foundation of all practices in life.",
      "startMs": "341080",
      "endMs": "349400",
      "startTimeText": "5:41"
    },
    {
      "text": "As Swami said,",
      "startMs": "346520",
      "endMs": "351640",
      "startTimeText": "5:46"
    },
    {
      "text": "you are not one person,",
      "startMs": "349400",
      "endMs": "353760",
      "startTimeText": "5:49"
    },
    {
      "text": "but three.",
      "startMs": "351640",
      "endMs": "357160",
      "startTimeText": "5:51"
    },
    {
      "text": "The one you think you are,",
      "startMs": "353760",
      "endMs": "360480",
      "startTimeText": "5:53"
    },
    {
      "text": "the one that others that others think",
      "startMs": "357160",
      "endMs": "361880",
      "startTimeText": "5:57"
    },
    {
      "text": "you are,",
      "startMs": "360480",
      "endMs": "366080",
      "startTimeText": "6:00"
    },
    {
      "text": "and the one who you truly are.",
      "startMs": "361880",
      "endMs": "367640",
      "startTimeText": "6:01"
    },
    {
      "text": "True self",
      "startMs": "366080",
      "endMs": "370600",
      "startTimeText": "6:06"
    },
    {
      "text": "is the Atma,",
      "startMs": "367640",
      "endMs": "374040",
      "startTimeText": "6:07"
    },
    {
      "text": "the divine reality within.",
      "startMs": "370600",
      "endMs": "375800",
      "startTimeText": "6:10"
    },
    {
      "text": "Realize it",
      "startMs": "374040",
      "endMs": "378280",
      "startTimeText": "6:14"
    },
    {
      "text": "and live it.",
      "startMs": "375800",
      "endMs": "380280",
      "startTimeText": "6:15"
    },
    {
      "text": "As we celebrate",
      "startMs": "378280",
      "endMs": "383280",
      "startTimeText": "6:18"
    },
    {
      "text": "100 years of Sri Sathya Sai Baba's",
      "startMs": "380280",
      "endMs": "385800",
      "startTimeText": "6:20"
    },
    {
      "text": "blessed advent,",
      "startMs": "383280",
      "endMs": "389720",
      "startTimeText": "6:23"
    },
    {
      "text": "may we all rededicate ourselves to his",
      "startMs": "385800",
      "endMs": "391760",
      "startTimeText": "6:25"
    },
    {
      "text": "divine message.",
      "startMs": "389720",
      "endMs": "393240",
      "startTimeText": "6:29"
    },
    {
      "text": "Love all,",
      "startMs": "391760",
      "endMs": "396200",
      "startTimeText": "6:31"
    },
    {
      "text": "serve all.",
      "startMs": "393240",
      "endMs": "398880",
      "startTimeText": "6:33"
    },
    {
      "text": "There is only one caste,",
      "startMs": "396200",
      "endMs": "402000",
      "startTimeText": "6:36"
